#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:5
#: 0ebafe85b0ce4f52a39356bba843695b
msgid "Underwater Sonar (Analog)"
msgstr "水下声呐（模拟）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:7
#: 8a3d3658b108480db53ecf8a312f9dfe
msgid ""
"This page details the setup of a low-cost analog underwater sonar (aka "
"\"fish finder\") and a digitizer to convert the analog readings into NMEA "
"0183 which can be read by ardupilot.  This setup allows measuring the depth "
"of the water below a boat.  The sensor described has a maximum claimed a "
"range of 300m and a relatively wide beam of 22deg."
msgstr ""
"本页详细介绍低成本模拟水下声呐（即「鱼探仪」）的设置，以及将模拟读数转换为 ArduPilot 可读的 NMEA 0183 "
"格式的数字化仪。此设置可测量船只下方水的深度。所描述的传感器最大量程为 300m，波束角较宽为 22 度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:9
#: 54f05ba213a44fdd912d54caafaea6d1
msgid ""
"These instructions were provided by `OlavA at the bottom of this "
"ardupilot.org blog post <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/mapping-a-lake-"
"with-ardupilot/32401/34>`__"
msgstr ""
"这些说明由 `OlavA 在该 ardupilot.org 博客文章底部 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/mapping-a-lake-with-ardupilot/32401/34>`__ "
"提供"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:13
#: 7eab2411c0e24f2794db7309107f96a8
msgid "*images courtesy of lowarnace.com and actisense.com*"
msgstr "*图片来自 lowarnace.com 和 actisense.com*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:16
#: 57623be65e6f49938995509e8867ae68
msgid "Recommended Hardware"
msgstr "推荐硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:18
#: b2a371024c7f40009f9bd0bffa3ebae7
msgid ""
"`Lowrance HST-WSBL 83/200 kHz Transom Mount Transducer "
"<https://www.lowrance.com/lowrance/type/sonar-transducers/hst-wsbl/>`__ "
"available from many retailers including `amazon.com "
"<https://www.amazon.com/Lowrance-HST-WSBL-Transom-Mount-"
"Transducer/dp/B000KKB5YK>`__.  Other sensors may also work."
msgstr ""
"`Lowrance HST-WSBL 83/200 kHz 船尾安装换能器 "
"<https://www.lowrance.com/lowrance/type/sonar-transducers/hst-wsbl/>`__，可从包括"
" `amazon.com <https://www.amazon.com/Lowrance-HST-WSBL-Transom-Mount-"
"Transducer/dp/B000KKB5YK>`__ 在内的多个零售商购买。其他传感器也可能适用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:19
#: d5062d5eb8d643869a2fbb768f8eb1cc
msgid ""
"`DST-2 200kHz digitizer <https://www.actisense.com/product/dst-2/>`__ "
"available from `many retailers <https://www.actisense.com/where-to-buy/>`__ "
"including `Navstore.com <https://www.navstore.com/actisense-"
"dst-2-200-active-dst-module-200-khz.html>`__ (`manuals here "
"<http://www.actisense.com/media/?product=dst-2&type=downloads>`__)"
msgstr ""
"`DST-2 200kHz 数字化仪 <https://www.actisense.com/product/dst-2/>`__，可从 `多家零售商 "
"<https://www.actisense.com/where-to-buy/>`__ 购买，包括 `Navstore.com "
"<https://www.navstore.com/actisense-dst-2-200-active-dst-"
"module-200-khz.html>`__ （`手册在此 "
"<http://www.actisense.com/media/?product=dst-2&type=downloads>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:22
#: 6fafce999be54fc981d28b5080c27c75
msgid "Connecting and Configuring"
msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:24
#: fc7b6eaecda64d70a1a8ea2969811aed
msgid ""
"The image below shows the pin-out of an airmar analog transducer, but the "
"pinout is the same as for the Lowrance HST-WSBL"
msgstr "下图显示的是 airmar 模拟换能器的引脚定义，但引脚排列与 Lowrance HST-WSBL 相同"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:28
#: 761d9efad4144878ad50c011a1deaec7
msgid ""
"The Lowrance HST-WSBL pins should be connected to the pins on the right side"
" of the DST-2, as shown below.   Note that the Lowrance HST-WSBL does not "
"have a speed sensor so only pins 1 and 4-7 should be connected"
msgstr ""
"Lowrance HST-WSBL 的引脚应如下图所示连接到 DST-2 右侧的引脚。注意 Lowrance HST-WSBL "
"没有速度传感器，因此只需连接引脚 1 和 4-7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:32
#: 41e2373dfc6d4c73b5e576bdaea442ed
msgid ""
"The DST-2 requires a 10V to 28V power source, meaning it can be powered from"
" a 3S or 4S lipo battery."
msgstr "DST-2 需要 10V 至 28V 的电源，可由 3S 或 4S 锂聚合物电池供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:34
#: af6db012bae8426695802c92d62d1f00
msgid ""
"Next pins on the left side of the DST-2 (serial and RS-232 output) should be"
" connected to the autopilot's telemetry/serial input. The easiest connection"
" method is to connect the DST-2's 5V serial output directly to the telemetry"
" port of the autopilot's Tx, Rx, and common ground.  It is best to check the"
" DST-2 docs before connecting but below shows how the telemetry pins from a "
"Pixhawk (or another autopilot) should be connected to the pins on the left "
"side of the DST-2."
msgstr ""
"接下来，DST-2 左侧的引脚（串口和 RS-232 输出）应连接到飞控的数传/串口输入。最简单的连接方式是将 DST-2 的 5V "
"串口输出直接连接到飞控数传端口的 Tx、Rx 和公共地。建议在连接前查阅 DST-2 文档，下图显示了 Pixhawk（或其他飞控）数传引脚应如何连接到"
" DST-2 左侧引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:38
#: 6b7ad16775b24c4b8e0136722ba197c5
msgid ""
"Connect with a ground station to the autopilot and set the following "
"parameters (these settings assume the first sensor is connected to "
"Telem2/Serial2)"
msgstr "通过地面站连接飞控并设置以下参数（假设第一个传感器连接到 Telem2/Serial2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:40
#: fed539ba02cc4235b0ae4beba3332f32
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9（激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:41
#: eb41770ff71c403e89efc51351c27f44
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 4 (4800 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 4（4800 波特）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:43
#: a379c221bd4741008d2b0f3e3ae01bec
msgid "Then the following range finder related parameters should be set:"
msgstr "然后应设置以下测距仪相关参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:45
#: c56136e9b12948b0a5104e7613934b94
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 17 (NMEA)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 17（NMEA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:46
#: b402d7ac0b4248a8949060a0ec1e49c0
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.13"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:47
#: ee4659fd69e0455eafe5b8de9eb92a84
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 300 (i.e. 300m).  *This is the distance "
"in meters that the rangefinder can reliably read.*"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 300（即 300m）。*这是测距仪可可靠读取的最大距离（米）。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:48
#: bb9a1f845fcd4800a134b37af631a7a5
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25 (i.e. down) if mounted on a boat"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25（即向下），如果安装在船上"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:51
#: a220e59ff73340a5be9b1de52d72ff37
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:53
#: 6e9e08e86e624eae821324beb3db6cfb
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看。请注意查找 「rangefinder1」。"
